        "owner_reply": "Hello,\nThank you for sharing your feedback. We're truly sorry that your order arrived after your holiday, that the items did not meet your expectations, and that the return process caused you additional frustration.\nOur team has already reached out to you via email regarding this matter so we can assist you further and work toward the best possible solution. Please kindly check your inbox (including your spam/junk folder) and reply to our email at your convenience.\nThank you for your patience and for giving us the opportunity to make things right.",
