        "page_number": 9,
        "rating_value": 1,
        "report": null,
        "review_body": "Order took over 4 weeks to arrive, despite saying 5-8 days. Had ordered specific items for a holiday, but they arrived while I was away.  Items themselves really disappointing - baggy and shapeless, fabric full of creases and would need endless ironing.  Returns process made deliberately complicated, involving photos of items (never come across another retailer who does that, can't believe they get away with it). Presumably returns made difficult because a lot of people want to use it - will be surprised if they actually pay up.",
